        {
            "id": "70e8bb92-0554-4583-8698-4eb4b641dae2",
            "build_id": "cf7503c2-3ef7-46e8-90fc-b18151572c83",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-21T21:56:55.971659+00:00",
            "notes": "New build includes [Blitz Barrage](item_b6bd0c8f-9bd2-4d3d-a353-1e70f74e131b) and [Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) \n\nIf you are surviving with Blitz get [Carpet Bomb](item_3c2ba051-0447-4a1c-8e07-8948136dff94)\n\nWhatever you don't get get it in round 5/7.\n\nFocus here is delete the backline or delete the tank if they have [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) or [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0)\n\nIf you are getting shot out of the sky play better, or get defense based upon what is happening, where the damage is coming from. \n  [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51)  for the additional [Ability Lifesteal](stat_ability_lifesteal)\n\n\nI have recently started to go  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) at a recommendation of another Pharah player I encountered, I do feel if they can't shoot you  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) limit your immediate burst potential.\n\nAdditional Detail: If you have a  [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) go  [Blitz Barrage](item_b6bd0c8f-9bd2-4d3d-a353-1e70f74e131b)  and right click delete him.",
