            "notes": "A slight modification to the build after some testing. \n\nRunning  [Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) allows for your barrages to tank almost all damage while in Barrage.\n\nAt this point in the game if you are super ahead  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) with  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) will allow you to do significant damage and grants you a lot of survivability. If you are behind at this point use  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) to help mitigate the attack damage.\n\n\nAdditional notes  if the enemy team has a  [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) and he is carrying the enemy, I recommend going  [Blitz Barrage](item_b6bd0c8f-9bd2-4d3d-a353-1e70f74e131b) and  [Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) round 3 and 5 to assist. Please note this changes your [jet dash]",
